It seems like we are counting the number of z values (or events) that satisfy some condition. Specifically, condition 2 increments w when: z+tb > x AND z < y AND z < 1440. Condition 1: z+tb < x -> skip (just advance z). Condition 4: z+tb == x OR z == y -> skip (advance z). Condition 3: z > y -> stop.

